#N canvas 40 40 1000 720 12;
#X text 20 12 Audio visuals – a little synth drives GPU visuals: its waveform as a texture \, a QML scene and shaders \, mixed into a window., f 125;
#X text 20 36 Switch DSP on (Ctrl+/). Click in the visuals window to change speed and pitch. Edit glow.frag while it runs., f 125;
